    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d328">

                <pb facs="0406" n="294" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg294"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.51/256</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gonzales</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-08-08T14:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 8, 1917, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your August 2, 4 p.m. Doctor Patterson, Subsecretary of State for Cuba, left this
                    morning for Washington carrying, I understand, all the data called for by the
                    Department.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
